---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /templates/
title: "All Roblox Templates & Asset Packs · Viral Templates"
description: "Every Roblox game template and asset pack we've built: fully scripted, production-ready, and inspired by current trending games. New drops added regularly."
---

<section class="section section--tall" style="padding-bottom: var(--s-12)">
  <div class="well">
    <div class="page-head">
    <h1 class="display">The full collection.</h1>
    <p class="hero__sub">
      Every template and asset pack we've built, fully scripted, production-ready, and
      inspired by current trending Roblox games. New drops added regularly.
    </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rating" style="margin-top: var(--s-8); justify-content: center">
      {% set fillPercent = (stats.averageOutOf5 / 5 * 100) | round %}
      {% include "components/stars.njk" %}
      <span class="rating__num"><span class="num">{{ stats.averageOutOf5 }}</span> out of 5 from <span class="num">{{ stats.ratedCount }}</span> rated reviews</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="hairline">

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="all-products">
  <div class="well">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="h2" id="all-products">Every game template and asset pack we sell</h2>
    </div>

    {%- set gridProducts = products | byOrder %}
    {% include "components/product-grid.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="well">
    <div class="cta-band__inner">
      <div>
        <h2 class="h2">Not sure which one fits your game?</h2>
        <p>Ask in the Discord before you buy. Screenshots of your game get you a straighter answer than this page can.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="{{ site.discord }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Join the Discord</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/contact/">Send a message instead</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
